## Coding rules
- Use `Decimal` for all money. Never use `float` for money.
- Round reported amounts with `money()` (ROUND_HALF_UP to 2 decimal places).
- Every behaviour change needs a test in `tests/`.
- Never edit or delete an existing test to make it pass. If a test seems
  wrong, stop and explain why instead.
- Do not add third-party dependencies without asking first.

## Working style
- Explain your plan before editing more than one file.
- Keep changes small; one concern per change.
- After changing code, run the tests and report the result honestly,
  including failures.

